    "detailed_description": "<strong>In this thrilling 2D arcade game, you control a rocket that constantly moves forward. Your mission is to steer the rocket left and right to destroy meteors and dodge obstacles. Every meteor destroyed adds to your score, and combo multipliers give you a chance to rack up even more points! Be careful though\u2014one collision and it's game over. Compete against yourself and others on the global leaderboard while facing unique challenges that push your skills to the limit. How high can you score?</strong>",
